[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/pulls/800","id":5089705505,"node_id":"PR_kwDOP_0Yuc8AAAABL16-IQ","html_url":"https://github.com/scanoss/crypto-finder/pull/800","diff_url":"https://github.com/scanoss/crypto-finder/pull/800.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/scanoss/crypto-finder/pull/800.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/issues/800","number":800,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"fix(callgraph): stop re-walking enclosing scopes for every Node function","user":{"login":"matiasdaloia","id":66310421,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjY2MzEwNDIx","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/66310421?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia","html_url":"https://github.com/matiasdaloia","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/matiasdaloia/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"## Problem\nIn production, the JS call-graph parse of large bundles runs into the 60 m job timeout. One example is `@stencil/core`, whose `compiler/stencil.js` is 13 MB; all 8 versions timed out. A goroutine dump and a CPU profile show the time going to two paths. Both rebuild, for every function, the names of every enclosing scope by walking each ancestor's whole body:\n- `nodeBoundNames`: 38% of CPU.\n- `scopeFor` → `collectEnclosingFunctionNames`: 55% of CPU.\n\nCode wrapped in an IIFE therefore costs O(functions × enclosing body size).\n\n## Fix\n- **Per-file cache.** `nodeScopeNames` is keyed by node `{start, end, type}`. It caches each scope's locals and each function's enclosing names.\n- **No merging.** `nodeNameSet` is a chain of the shared sets with `has(name)`, so nothing is merged or copied per function.\n- **Same membership semantics.** This covers `nodeScope.declares`, the callback consumers and the webcrypto lookups. Outside `ParseFile`, the names are computed uncached, as before.\n\n## Tests\n- `TestNodeParser_BundleParsesInLinearTime` builds one IIFE with 2,000 functions. It fails on main (2m53s against a 30 s bound) and passes on the branch in 0.7 s, or 1.65 s with `-race`.\n- `BenchmarkNodeParser_Bundle`:\n\n  | Functions | main | branch |\n  |---|---|---|\n  | 250 | 2.41 s | 75 ms |\n  | 500 | 9.68 s | 153 ms |\n  | 1000 | 39.4 s | 320 ms |\n\n- Two equivalence cases in `TestBuilder_NodeCallbackReferences` cover outer-arrow single parameters, grandparent and IIFE `var` bindings, and sibling scopes. All existing Node tests pass unchanged.\n- `go test ./...` passes except the javac-dependent `TestExternalMethodSignaturePropagatesGenericParametersFromBytecode`, which also fails on main. golangci-lint v2.10.1 reports 0 issues.\n\n## Real-world check\nAll runs used the `0.44.1-deps` image with this binary and `SCANOSS_SCANNER_JOBS=1`.\n- `@stencil/core@4.45.2`:\n  - Total: **468 s, exit 0**.\n  - Call-graph parse: **28.8 s**, down from more than 50 min (it hit the timeout).\n  - Graph: 36,955 functions.\n- `node-forge@1.3.1` and `jose@4.15.9`: `f.json` is byte-identical between main and the branch. `g.json` is identical apart from `exported_at`.\n\n## Not fixed here\n- `withModuleVariables` copies module bindings once per function. On flat bundles that is still quadratic; on stencil it is about 12% of the parse.\n- `nodeEntryRefs` → `nodeScopeDeclaration` is about 13% of the parse.","created_at":"2026-10-30T19:08:23Z","updated_at":"2026-10-30T19:32:06Z","closed_at":"2026-10-30T19:32:04Z","merged_at":"2026-10-30T19:32:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"5ee6d7b9f9d71afe6dfdc6cc1b0e5c204dbcd179","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/pulls/800/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/pulls/800/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/issues/800/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/scanoss/crypto-finder/statuses/0d9e78a28461e10140ab837744abe0fbdd3d380f","head":{"label":"scanoss:fix/node-bound-names-quadratic","ref":"fix/node-bound-names-quadratic","sha":"0d9e78a28461e10140ab837744abe0fbdd3d380f","user":{"login":"scanoss","id":50915407,"node_id":"MDEyOk9yZ2FuaXphdGlvbjUwOTE1NDA3","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50915407?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss","html_url":"https://github.com/scanoss","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/scanoss/received_events","type":"Organization","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":1073551545,"node_id":"R_kgDOP_0YuQ","name":"crypto-finder","full_name":"scanoss/crypto-finder","private":false,"owner":{"login":"scano